member.remarks:

A  value where Yes indicates that empty arrays are allowed; 
otherwise, No. The default value is No.

This property applies only to multi-valued parameters.

member.summary:
Interface to encapsulate target device properties and features,
including, but not limited:
    - avail. fonts;
    - font/color mapping;
    - conversion of logical units to physical (dpi);
    - etc.
